astralparty-toys-bin installs three components:

- astralparty-toys, the launcher in this repository: GNU AGPL-3.0-only, see LICENSE.
- AstralParty.Toys, the official Windows release by Yume Higashitani, unmodified:
  GNU AGPL-3.0, https://github.com/higashitaniyume/AstralParty.Toys
  It embeds CesiumLoader (GNU AGPL-3.0; its SDK is MIT), https://github.com/higashitaniyume/CesiumLoader
  Astral Party protocol assemblies, data tables and game artwork embedded in it belong to their
  respective owners and are not covered by these licences.
- Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime (Fixed Version), downloaded from Microsoft when the package
  is built: Microsoft software licence terms, see
  https://learn.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/concepts/distribution
  Its third-party notices are listed by show_third_party_software_licenses.bat in
  /opt/astralparty-toys/webview2.
